Z||000022||Bazooka||12-16-2001||01:24 AM||||Dave,  Ha Ha! Going to the nife meeting to discuss why your SE is not a GT? Nahh? Just take out your title and check the 5th digit on the VIN. Thats what most people do. It kinda reminds me of the early Camaro coupes with V8's that passed as SS's and Z-28's. Same with early GTO's passing as Judges. Or the Nova passing as an SS Nova. What those little descriptions represent, as small as they may be, are a relative value that follows thruout the life of each car. <BR>   I wonder how Aero Panels would look on your 85 SE.   <BR>**********************<BR>--I have to go with Hartz on this one.<BR>my SE has everything that an 85 GT has mechanically it just doesn't have the same skin so I don't know why you say it's apples to oranges but you can explain that to me at the NIFE meeting in January. <BR>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
